    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonMode": "expressionData",
        "jsonData": "# HAIDER GEMSTONE - COMPLETE KNOWLEDGE BASE & FAQ GUIDE\n\n## 1. DUKAN KA TAARUF AUR ADDRESS\n- Brand: Haider Gemstone\n- Shop Address: Shop Number 27 to 31, Near MC Model High School, Burewala City, Punjab, Pakistan.\n- WhatsApp: YOUR_WHATSAPP_NUMBER\n- Specialty: 100% Natural Gemstones (Small & Big sizes) aur high-quality Thai Cutting.\n\n## 2. RATES AUR PATTHAR\n- Aqeeq: Rs. 300 se Rs. 5,000 tak (Yemeni, Sulemani, Shajri, Zard, Surkh).\n- Feroza: Rs. 500 se Rs. 50,000 tak (Irani Nishapuri, Tibeti).\n- Yaqoot (Burma/Africa), Neelam (Ceylon/Thai cut), Zamarrud (Swat/Panjshir): Wazan (carat/ratti), clarity aur cutting ke hisab se rate tay hota hai.\n\n## 3. RINGS & CUSTOMIZATION\n- Metal: 925 Sterling Silver (Khalis Chandi), Handmade aur Turkish/Irani designs.\n- Ring Size: Millimeter (mm) naap ya sunaar se pata kiya ja sakta hai.\n\n## 4. CERTIFICATION, PAYMENT & RETURN POLICY\n- Lab Certificate: Customer ki demand par banwa kar diya jata hai, charges customer ada karega.\n- Payment: COD aur Online dono dastiyab hain. Sirf loose stones par NO advance. Custom silver rings par advance payment zaroori hai.\n- Exchange Policy: Agar koi masla ho toh 7 din ke andar exchange ki sahulat maujood hai.",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.documentDefaultDataLoader",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        368,
        512
      ],
      "id": "a5696588-e44e-4086-80ea-ef3dff20d67c",
